 BSE|
 BSE| Excitation n           i =>/<=     a      TDA/ABBA       |X_ia^n|/|Y_ia^n|
 BSE|
 BSE|            1          13    =>    14        -ABBA-                  0.6513
 BSE|            1          13    =>    17        -ABBA-                  0.1839
